  "description": "Ready to actually finish a 75-day challenge? Reset75 keeps you honest. All data stays on your phone.\n\nPick from 6 challenge templates or build your own with any combination of 20 tasks across 6 categories. Log daily tasks, capture progress photos, track streaks, and generate timelapse videos from your photos.\n\nAnswers to your challenge questions\nΓÇó Which 75-day challenge is right for me?\nΓÇó How do I stay motivated past day 21?\nΓÇó What happens if I miss a day?\nΓÇó How do I track my progress photos over 75 days?\nΓÇó Can I customize my own fitness challenge?\nΓÇó Am I actually improving week over week?\n\nChallenge templates\nΓÇó 75 Tough ΓÇö strict mode with workouts, diet, water, reading, and progress photos\nΓÇó 75 Soft ΓÇö forgiving mode for a balanced approach\nΓÇó 75 Hotter ΓÇö fitness, skincare, self-care, and journaling\nΓÇó Glow Within ΓÇö meditation, journaling, reading, and no social media after 9pm\nΓÇó 30-Day Kickstart ΓÇö a shorter challenge to build momentum\nΓÇó Custom ΓÇö choose from 20 tasks across 6 categories, set any duration (21, 28, 30, 90 days, or more)\n\nDaily task tracking\nΓÇó 6 input types: checkbox, counter, duration, photo, text, measurement\nΓÇó Track workouts, water intake, meals, reading, journaling\nΓÇó Set per-task reminders at your preferred time\nΓÇó Strict mode restarts your count if you miss a day\nΓÇó Forgiving mode lets you skip and keep going\n\nProgress photos & timelapse\nΓÇó Capture daily photos from your camera or gallery\nΓÇó Browse your full photo gallery with day labels\nΓÇó Compare any two photos side by side\nΓÇó Generate a timelapse video from your photos\nΓÇó Add overlays: day counter, completed tasks, weight chart, watermark\nΓÇó Save to your camera roll or share directly\n\nStatistics & insights\nΓÇó Completion rate, best streak, and days completed\nΓÇó Daily completion chart with touch tooltips\nΓÇó Category breakdown: fitness, nutrition, hydration, mind, self-care\nΓÇó Individual task progress bars\nΓÇó Numeric trend charts for weight, water, steps\nΓÇó Lifetime view across all challenges\n\nShareable progress cards\nΓÇó 3 card styles: task checklist, calendar grid, or both\nΓÇó Share daily or challenge completion cards\nΓÇó Streak badges and Reset75 branding included\n\nReminders & notifications\nΓÇó Per-challenge and per-task reminder times\nΓÇó Choose which days to get notified\nΓÇó Timezone-aware scheduling\n\nHome screen widgets\nΓÇó Calendar grid widget showing your completed days\nΓÇó Today's tasks widget with completion status\nΓÇó Updates automatically as you log\n\n20 themes\nΓÇó Free: Graphite, Chalk, Daylight\nΓÇó Pro: Midnight, Coral, Ember, Gilded, Golden, Cobalt, Navy, Neon, Cyber, Paper, Ink, Rose, Velvet, Bloom, Storm, Mint, Forest\n\nPrivate & on-device\nΓÇó All data stays on your phone\nΓÇó No account required. Works offline\nΓÇó No data sharing. Ever\nΓÇó Available in 39 languages\n\n75 days. You either did it or you didn't.\n\nQuestions or feedback? Reach out through the app's Help section.",
